                    insight_durable:        `Credible and durable: you recovered the say-on-pay vote to ≥80% with material, verifiable ESG pay in the long-term incentive, capped and financially gated — and a package the CEO will stay for. You fixed the alignment, not the optics.`,
                    insight_greenwash:      `Greenwashing risk: the headline weight looked bold, but it rests on metrics no one can audit. Investors may pass it once, then punish the first year the CEO earns ESG pay on unverifiable progress.`,
